    <briefdescription>
<para>Called when a visible actor is hidden from a player. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This event is only called when the actor&apos;s visibility status is actually changed. It is called regardless of whether the actor is within the player&apos;s tracking range.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classendstone_1_1Player_1a854e72b6435abae0421ced0d2dbc2833" kindref="member">Player::hideEntity()</ref> </para>
